From 05548b713e82687e65c4bcfa687ecf47954f089a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kasniya <36neelansh@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:07:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] perf(decorate): glow lichen search stops on a read-only miss;
 geode writes interned layer states

multiface: vanilla's search revisits the same neighbour search_range times; an attempt that
found no supporting face read blocks only (no write, draw or tally), so the remaining
iterations repeat it exactly and are skipped. One probe per open-cell test, keyed
can_be_placed_on cache, no Vec/state clones on the miss path.

geode: simple layer providers and crack air interned once per run and written with
set_block_id; cannot_replace answered once per StateKey. Noise and float order untouched.

Digest df701ee858e2bdd3 unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
